caption: Yin Yang Embodiment of Balance
tradition-component: yin-yang-embodiment-of-balance

Cost: 100 points

Prerequisites: Yin Master, Yang Master, Occult Mastery (High Magic); cannot have Embodiment of Yin or Yang

Requirements: Magery 5, Thaumatology 30, Yin 30, Yang 30

You embody the perfect balance between creation and destruction, male and female, light and dark. You may change your primary and secondary sexual characteristics at will, along with your weight, height, eye, hair, and skin color to anything that is even remotely plausible for your species. You must add the Universal modifier to your appearance. You no longer need to eat, drink, breathe, age, or sleep, but you may if you wish and may gain as much enjoyment of it as anyone else. You no longer suffer penalties from specifying or not the caps on your parameters, and gain full benefit from aspect resonance for all High Magic spells: you are treated as using the better of Yin and Yang for your casting in all aspects.
